# IsoRim Waylith - VGE Pack, batch B3: doors. stuff* = tinted by the door's stuff (VGE's airlock art is drawn white and
# tinted the same way); fixed colours from VGE's art for the windows and the vac barrier frames.
newmtl stuff_vgeb3
Kd 0.86 0.86 0.86
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}
newmtl stuff_vgeb3_dark
Kd 0.62 0.62 0.62
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}
newmtl stuff_vgeb3_hi
Kd 0.98 0.98 0.98
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/{stuff}
newmtl vgeb3_window
Kd 0.24 0.24 0.25
newmtl vgeb3_vac
Kd 0.42 0.42 0.43
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/Metal
